ers mostly call the race Likely or Lean Republican, and prediction markets give Hinojosa roughly a one-in-four chance. Abbott has made defensive moves, pausing data center permits amid tightening polls, suggesting the race is competitive but still tilts his way heading into the final stretch.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.1819, "margin": -4.27}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.2193, "margin": -4.0}]}